==Notes==
* Pikin was accidently removed after the "International Talk like a Pirate Day" event. He was put back in a later update
* Shares the skill [[Shatter Enchantment]] with [[Libeh]] and the skill [[Empowerment]] with [[Shiloh]], making him one of only a few hero skill trainers that teaches the same skill as another hero skill trainer. The only other two hero skill trainers with this trait are the aforementioned Libeh and Shiloh.
